haracteristic Arianism of the ἠν ὅτε οὐκ ἦν and the ἐξ οὐκ ὄντων .”— Newman’s The Arians of the Fourth Century , p. 97. See also Hagenbach’s History of Doctrines , vol. i. pp. 130–133. S.]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1548"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1549]: For αὐτοῦ Boherellus conjectures αὑτοῦ , and translates, “ Propria ipse principia , quæ sunt Epicuri, subruens .”","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1549"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1550]: Rom. xi. 36 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1550"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1551]: οὐδὲ λογῷ ἐφικτός .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1551"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1552]: εἴτε ἐνδιαθέτῳ εἴτε καὶ προφορικῷ .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1552"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1553]: John i. 1 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1553"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1554]: οὐδὲν τῶν ἐν λέξεσι καὶ σημαινομένοις .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1554"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1555]: χειραγωγῆσαι .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1555"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1556]: κολάζεσθαι .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1556"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1557]: Cf. Matt. iv. 16 . and Isa. ix. 2 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1557"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1558]: John xiv. 6 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1558"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1559]: Cf. Isa. v. 20 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1559"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1560]: ὀφθαλμούς .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1560"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1561]: ὀφθαλμούς ."